  "title": "Nomadar and SID Collaborate to Support International Football Talent Between Asia and Spain",
  "summary": "Nomadar has signed a collaboration agreement with SID (Spanish International Development), an organization specialized in international football development programs with a presence in Hong Kong and Macau. Through this agreement, SID will be able to connect international players and sports projects with Nomadar’s high-performance football programs, especially: High Performance Training (HPT) Football Trials in Spain […]",
